            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Anxious_Hat_Close_Up.png",
            "caption": "merch",
            "heading": "Anxiously Attached Hat $25",
            "text": "<p>If you’ve ever been to therapy, opened Instagram, or been a queer in Seattle, you know about attachment styles. Help a loved one embrace their anxious attachment (to coffee) with this embroidered hat.</p><p></p><p>Classic fit, soft fabric, adjustable, and entirely judgment-free.</p>",
